Examples and evidence, please?  Are there enough identifiable
criticisms in adult medium-range mammals to serve as a workable set
for a human?

Which brings me to another question.  Is anyone doing comparative
studies of the sets of criticisms held by various groups of people
(and animals?)?  Is there anything of interest here?


